      "priority": "should",
      "action": "keep cyclomatic complexity below {{MAX_COMPLEXITY}} for every function, failing the build on new violations and tracking existing ones as technical debt",
      "rationale": "Highly branched functions need disproportionately many test cases and are where defects concentrate; a hard limit forces decomposition while the code is still fresh."
